VERSION 2
RULE baseline.cpp.core.information_leakage_across_trust_boundaries_security_risk VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\bclass\\s+\\w+\\s*\\(" "im"
WHEN (TEXT_MISSING "memset\\s*\\(|sanitize|redact|encrypt|mask" "im" AND TEXT_MISSING "test|example" "im")
REPORT "Information Leakage Across Trust Boundaries: Security Risk"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
